(Three-level nesting and chained element access - plan 040 stage 1e1.
 A list may contain a list that contains a list; `element N of element N
 of ...` chains through the runtime tag to reach the innermost child.)

a list called "deep" is [1, [2, [3, 4]], 5].
print deep.
print element 2 of deep.
print element 2 of element 2 of deep.